stateDiagram-v2
state Panel {
  [*] --> Loading
  Loading --> Ready: Both reads succeed
  Loading --> Unavailable: Either read fails
  Unavailable --> Loading: Refresh
  Ready --> Saving: Save hidden draft or publish exact file version
  Saving --> Loading: Receipt advances publication version
  Saving --> Refused: Server refuses stale or inaccessible content
  Refused --> Loading: Refresh authoritative versions
  Saving --> Uncertain: Server does not confirm
  Uncertain --> Saving: Retry same action and key
  Uncertain --> Loading: Refresh current server state
  Ready --> Loading: Refresh
  Loading --> Closed: Close deal or session changes
  Ready --> Closed: Close deal or session changes
  Saving --> Closed: Close deal or session changes
  Refused --> Closed: Close deal or session changes
  Uncertain --> Closed: Close deal or session changes
  Unavailable --> Closed: Close deal or session changes
  --
  [*] --> Unconfirmed
  Unconfirmed --> Confirmed: Receipt advances publication version
  Confirmed --> Unconfirmed: Save hidden draft or publish exact file version
  %% never SaveAwaitsReceipt: Saving & Confirmed -- A pending write never displays a confirmed new version.
  %% never RefusalIsUnconfirmed: Refused & Confirmed -- Refused writes never confirm a new version.
}
